{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S07-S09、S11 将失去亲密的痛具体落在对方是否还需要他的陪伴上，略有把更宽泛的亲密关系收窄为被需要感的风险。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S03 加入询问对方是否也有同样感受，使表达心意之外又多了一条寻求相互确认的支线。\",\n    \"S13 把矛盾更集中地写成渴望得到永不改变的承诺、又想藏回喜欢以避免受伤，容易将主线偏向对承诺的焦虑和自我保护，而不只是亲密幸福与无法留住它的交织。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条线都包含亲密的欢喜、害怕失去、想继续给予却无法保证未来，以及不愿收回喜欢的矛盾。X 更贴近 Center：S13 不仅渴望保证，还追问即使得到保证，未来是否真的能一直这么好；S14 又明确落在「又甜又酸，却不后悔」，使幸福与留不住的痛楚成为同一体验的两面。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3eebd7fa-5cfd-41be-a8d2-aa3c6c57491f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T093228256435Z", "elapsed_seconds": 31.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:32:59.807151+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9cd0186bd4ba17b813802aa9fb1228fe61447aad6a86bd539cc93be5ddab1306", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at